            u_xlat16_1.x = u_xlat16_0.w * vs_TEXCOORD3.z + -0.00100000005;\n    u_xlat0
            = u_xlat16_0 * vs_TEXCOORD3.zzzz;\n    SV_Target0 = u_xlat0;\n    u_xlatb4
            = u_xlat16_1.x<0.0;\n    if(u_xlatb4){discard;}\n    return;\n}\n\n"
